OL,3,GNEWSACouncil asks public not to
OL,4,Aspeculate over fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have been urged not to speculate
OL,7,Fover the cause of a fire which
OL,8,Fdestroyed a row of houses last month.
OL,10,FMultiple wildfires broke out across the
OL,11,FWest Midlands on the hottest day of the
OL,12,Fyear, with Gorleston Road, Warstock,
OL,13,Famong the affected areas. The fire
OL,14,Fdevastated several back gardens, while
OL,15,Fsix homes ravaged by the blaze remain
OL,16,Ffenced off.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
