OL,3,GNEWSACouncil asks public not to
OL,4,Aspeculate over fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing the events of 13 August,
OL,7,FBirmingham City Council said it was
OL,8,Fcommitted to mitigating future fire
OL,9,Frisks while also "safeguarding
OL,10,Fbiodiversity and the wider natural
OL,11,Fenvironment".
OL,13,FResidents have spoken about the scenes
OL,14,Fthey witnessed and the deep shock that
OL,15,Ffollowed, with one woman saying it was
OL,16,Fa "miracle" they still had a house.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
